 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Fixed
+
+- `herdr_api`: the blocking client no longer loses a reply on macOS when herdr answers and closes before the client sets its read timeout. `setsockopt` fails there on a socket whose peer closed (EINVAL), and the call came back as `NoReply` although herdr had done it. The read timeout is now set before the request goes out.
+
